{"session_id": "01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813", "turn_id": "01a0efdf-495c-7873-b0f5-14fc90add44d", "transcript_path": "/home/hera/.codex/sessions/2026/09/29/rollout-2026-09-29T18-13-03-01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813.jsonl", "cwd": "/home/hera/measurements/zack/20260822-vti-02", "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "permission_mode": "bypassPermissions", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "nb-collab append 20260822_ana.ipynb --markdown '## Runs 6\u20137 \u2014 SdH spot checks: raw transport\n\nRun 6 is the electron-side D=0 field traverse (n\u2248+3.2\u00d710\u00b9\u00b2 cm\u207b\u00b2, 0\u219210 T); run 7 is the hole-side return (n\u2248\u22121.2\u00d710\u00b9\u00b2 cm\u207b\u00b2, 10\u21920.3 T). These plots show the measured-current-normalized Rxx, drain current and TG/BG current before any spectral interpretation. Both use the fixed T_0\u2192B_3 drive and B_1\u2212B_2 voltage pair.' --code-file hera_scratch/ana_spot_raw.py --execute"}, "tool_use_id": "exec-6a245f34-626f-4c2a-ad59-66a7135c32d5"}
{"session_id": "01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813", "turn_id": "01a0efdf-495c-7873-b0f5-14fc90add44d", "transcript_path": "/home/hera/.codex/sessions/2026/09/29/rollout-2026-09-29T18-13-03-01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813.jsonl", "cwd": "/home/hera/measurements/zack/20260822-vti-02", "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "permission_mode": "bypassPermissions", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "nb-collab append 20260822_ana.ipynb --markdown '## Runs 6\u20137 \u2014 oscillation content\n\nThe raw traces oscillate well above the noise floor and never approach the sr1 full scale. The spectrum below uses the 2\u201310 T window; low-frequency residual and harmonics are explicitly treated as ambiguous until a density\u2013field map shows their trajectories.' --code-file hera_scratch/ana_spot_fft.py --execute"}, "tool_use_id": "exec-d584cf73-3fb2-4e02-9d53-8c321b02c8f6"}
{"session_id": "01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813", "turn_id": "01a0efdf-495c-7873-b0f5-14fc90add44d", "transcript_path": "/home/hera/.codex/sessions/2026/09/29/rollout-2026-09-29T18-13-03-01a0efdf-4955-7aa0-8194-fe34e165c813.jsonl", "cwd": "/home/hera/measurements/zack/20260822-vti-02", "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "permission_mode": "bypassPermissions", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "nb-collab append 20260822_ana.ipynb --markdown '### Runs 6\u20137 \u2014 take\n\nBoth field traces advance the campaign: oscillations are clear, drain current stays near 9.9 nA, and the largest voltage is only 10\u201312% of the 50 \u00b5V lock-in scale. The run-6 2\u201310 T FFT has peaks near 5, 15, 22.5 and 30 T; run 7 has peaks near 5, 12.5 and 22.5 T. The ~5\u20137 T component is close to the detrend residual band and several higher peaks may be harmonics, so assigning them to independent bands would overread these spots. The onset helper finds a robust 12.6 T hole-side tone from ~1.6 T; its 7.1 T low edge is censored by the analysis window. The next measurement is the D=0 Landau fan (plan step 4), with B as the slow axis and the calibrated density line as the fast axis.'"}, "tool_use_id": "exec-42697317-39fc-40de-9191-da18a68bd912"}
